scf_t_model  @ce5f656d
  why   A model small enough to solve by hand: its energies are known
        exactly, so the tests can check the loop without integrals.
  na      the number of alpha electrons
  nb      the number of beta electrons
  method  the method to ask for
  h       the core Hamiltonian: orbital energies `0`, `1`, `2`
  s       the overlap: the identity
  g       the packed integrals: `(ii|ii)` on each orbital, zero elsewhere
  i       an orbital
